SIGN AND SHARE YOUR OWN PUZZLES</h2><br>Unleash your creativity with our full-featured level editor! Craft your own unique puzzles or even design epic campaigns with multiple levels and branching. Go beyond classic level design with your own adventures, narratives, or interactive sandbox creations!<br><br>Instantly play community-made levels, unlocking unlimited content and challenges. Ready to test your logic skills and challenge others player puzzles?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312770/extras/c93b3be90291d09b4db63ef5e99f446f.poster.avif?t=1723801631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312770/extras/c93b3be90291d09b4db63ef5e99f446f.webm?t=1723801631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312770/extras/c93b3be90291d09b4db63ef5e99f446f.mp4?t=1723801631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GO FURTHER</h2><br>Experience next-level innovation with Linkito! It connects to the real world in unprecedented ways.<br><br>You can try the Twitch-integrated campaign where viewers join forces in real-time, creating an electrifying vibe in the chat. Plus, with OSC support, you can seamlessly control music software, or use the serial port to interact with electronics. It's never been easier to create whatever you imagine in a fun and intuitive way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312770/extras/6b5e3e6b7288d404a6209d0b927c983a.poster.avif?t=1723801631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312770/extras/6b5e3e6b7288d404a6209d0b927c983a.webm?t=1723801631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312770/extras/6b5e3e6b7288d404a6209d0b927c983a.mp4?t=1723801631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Just use your logic, <strong>no knowledge required</strong><br><br></li><li>Various <strong>connection-based puzzles</strong><br><br></li><li><strong>Uncover the truth</strong> about Albatross Technologies in an original 50s dystopian setting<br><br></li><li>Complete <strong>level-editor &amp; sandbox</strong> mode<br><br></li><li>Browse <strong>community created levels</strong> directly in the game<br><br></li><li>Connect the game to Twitch or other systems</li></ul>",
